# Role definitions are synced here from agents/ by tools/sync-agents.mjs and deliberately not
# versioned (process/bootstrap-guide.md, step 4). .claude/commands/ and .claude/settings.json ARE
# versioned — they carry this repository's process commands and shared permissions.
